    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="J19nB044-start">
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">All the Buddhas in the ocean-like assembly are heard from afar,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Auspicious clouds gather everywhere,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">With sincere intention and earnestness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">The Buddhas manifest their complete forms.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1201.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Námó Běnshī Shìjiā Mónífó (Homage to the Original Teacher Śākyamuni Buddha)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a15.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">The unsurpassed, profound, and subtle Dharma,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a15.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Is difficult to encounter in hundreds of thousands of kalpas.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a16.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Now I see, hear, receive, and uphold it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a16.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">I vow to understand the Tathāgata's true meaning.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a17.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Bōrě Bōluómìduō Xīnjīng (The Heart Sūtra of Perfect Wisdom)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a18.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Translated under imperial order by the Tang Dynasty Tripiṭaka Master Xuánzàng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">When the Bodhisattva Guānzìzài was practicing the profound Prajñāpāramitā,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">He illuminated and saw that the five aggregates are all empty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">And transcended all suffering and distress.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Śāriputra!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Form is not different from emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Emptiness is not different from form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Form is precisely emptiness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Emptiness is precisely form;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Feeling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Thought,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Volition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Consciousness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Are also like this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Śāriputra!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">All dharmas are characterized by emptiness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">They are neither produced nor destroyed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Neither defiled nor pure,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Neither increasing nor decreasing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">Therefore, in emptiness there is no form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No feeling,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No thought,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No volition,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No consciousness;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No eye,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No ear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#J19nB044_CBETA_1-0129a1901.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-24T18:33:28.075+09:00">No nose,</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
